keGLV`, `scalarMulGLVAndFakeGLV`) gets the result point from a prover-supplied hint and then checks a relation, without computing the point in-circuit. Nothing checked that the hinted point is on the curve. The final accumulator identity is a group-law argument, so it holds trivially for an off-curve operand. A malicious prover could therefore make the gadget return any point they chose.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRelease v0.16.4 · Consensys-Incorporated/gnark · GitHub (https://github.com/Consensys/gnark/releases/tag/v0.16.4)\nciteturn10view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"turn9view1\",\"pattern\":\"e974\"}); Redirected to URL: https://github.com/Consensys-Incorporated/gnark/releases/tag/v0.16.4; Total lines: 258\nNo matching text found for \"e974\"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\ninit commit · infinigence/STAlloc@3a9f97f · GitHub (https://github.com/infinigence/STAlloc/commit/3a9f97ff4896c46ffb65b229ba7347358b400387)\nciteturn10view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 months ago; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"turn8view1\",\"pattern\":\"committed\"}); Total lines: 607\nL131: ## Use saved searches to filter your results more quickly\nL132: \nL133: [Input]\nL134: \nL135: [Input]\nL136: \nL137: Name [Input: github-ruby] [Input]\nL138: \nL139: Query [Input: (repo:mona/a OR repo:mona/b) AND lang:python]\nL140: \nL141: To see all available qualifiers, see our 【61†documentation†docs.github.com】.\nL142: \nL143: [Button: Cancel ] [Button: Create saved search ]\nL144: \nL145: 【62†Sign up】\nL146: \nL147: Appearance settings\nL148: \nL149: [Button: Resetting focus]\nL150: You signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. Dismiss al